+ *
+ * FROZEN CONTRACT, honoured first and before any repair: a delivery with no
+ * siginfo, or with si_code <= 0 (SI_USER/SI_QUEUE/SI_TKILL/SI_TIMER/...), is
+ * user-generated and needs none of the engine's maintenance. It goes straight
+ * to box64dl_signal_deliver() with the kernel entry variant forwarded
+ * unchanged. A thread with no guest context is forwarded the same way with
